([TableScrollContainer.d.ts:14-15](node_modules/@mantine/core/lib/components/Table/TableScrollContainer.d.ts:14)) It's listed on the [Table](https://mantine.dev/core/table/) docs page under `Table.ScrollContainer` props, and accepts any prop `ScrollArea` itself takes (including `type`, `scrollbarSize`, `offsetScrollbars`, etc.) — see the [ScrollArea](https://mantine.dev/core/scroll-area/) docs for the full list.
